<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - New Zealand Telecom cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - New Zealand Telecom cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities analyst Tony Rogers said on Thursday he cut his rating for Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd to underperformer from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe that the stock's fundamentals and valuation have lost touch with reality and that the price is being supported by imminent buyback,&quot; he wrote in an analysis.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed down 1-3/8 to 83-1/4 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
